# Gentleman Guardian Angel — adversarial code review, BLOCKING.
#
# AFTER lint-staged, not before: eslint --fix and prettier --write REWRITE the
# staged files, so running the review first would judge code that is not the
# code being committed.
#
# This app has carried a fully configured .gga — provider, file patterns,
# exclusions, AGENTS.md as its rule file, strict mode — while nothing invoked
# it. The wrapper has run it as a blocking pre-commit hook all along; these
# three repos did not, so substantial code shipped with CI and lint behind it
